# Copy to .env.local. Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser.

# The orchestrator API's origin; the dashboard adds /factorial (tech-stack decision 74). Under
# `make dev` the dashboard is http://localhost:5173/factorial/ and calls it cross-origin, so the
# API must list this dev server in FACTORIAL_CORS_ORIGINS (see the repo-root .env.example).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# The terminal gateway's origin is not set here: the API names it at run time
# (FACTORIAL_TERMINAL__PUBLIC_URL in the repo-root .env.example), http://localhost:8001 under
# `make dev`.

# The API token is deliberately NOT here: it is a shared secret, and anything in
# a VITE_ variable is compiled into the bundle in plaintext. The dashboard never holds it:
# a person signs in, and the browser keeps only the HttpOnly session cookie.
